        "created_at": "2015-08-21T04:02:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>These are REALLY awesome. I especcially love the coplications and fkavor stuff.</p><p>I hope you don't mind if i use and moodify these for my game that I run. My players actually will be having a run in with some of the freedom 5 rather soon so i need to be prepared. Well, it's actually Haka, Setback, Unity, Tempest. As well as a new addition to the Super Ranks, a pre-teen psychic name Augry. She became a hero after being saved from her own living nightmares by a group of heroes, she especailly looks up to the Visonary but she doesn't think her idol likes her too &nbsp;much.</p>",
